WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.150
"Help!"

2
00:00:03.151 --> 00:00:07.023
Ricky was stuck in the sand.

3
00:00:07.024 --> 00:00:10.854
"I need to be in the water!"

4
00:00:10.855 --> 00:00:13.883
"We'll help you!" Rex cried.

5
00:00:13.884 --> 00:00:23.265
Rex and Sara pushed.

6
00:00:23.266 --> 00:00:28.379
But Ricky was too heavy.

7
00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:33.017
Rex looked around.

8
00:00:33.018 --> 00:00:40.802
Sid was snoring loudly.

9
00:00:40.803 --> 00:00:44.102
"Ugh," Rex said.

10
00:00:44.103 --> 00:00:46.336
"Sid can't help.

11
00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:49.152
He's sleeping!"

12
00:00:49.153 --> 00:00:52.143
Tor ran over.

13
00:00:52.144 --> 00:00:54.390
"I'll help—ack!

14
00:00:54.391 --> 00:00:57.614
My foot got wet!"

15
00:00:57.615 --> 00:01:00.596
"Thanks, Tor," Rex said.

16
00:01:00.597 --> 00:01:03.622
"Let's push!"

17
00:01:03.623 --> 00:01:12.549
Rex, Tor, and Sara pushed.

18
00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.796
Ricky still didn't move.

19
00:01:15.797 --> 00:01:20.024
"Oh no." Ricky looked worried.

20
00:01:20.025 --> 00:01:21.858
"This is—"

21
00:01:21.859 --> 00:01:25.214
Suddenly Ricky moved!

22
00:01:25.215 --> 00:01:28.733
"Huh?" Rex looked over.

23
00:01:28.734 --> 00:01:34.160
"Sid! You're awake!"

24
00:01:34.161 --> 00:01:43.989
The buddies all pushed.

25
00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:46.994
Ricky slid back into the water.

26
00:01:46.995 --> 00:01:57.461
Waves splashed on him.

27
00:01:57.462 --> 00:02:00.491
"Thank you!" Ricky said.

28
00:02:00.492 --> 00:02:03.435
"Who wants to play now?"

29
00:02:03.436 --> 00:02:09.732
"Me!" Rex, Sara, and Tor said.

30
00:02:09.733 --> 00:02:12.804
Sid yawned.

31
00:02:12.805 --> 00:02:14.740
"Not me.

32
00:02:14.741 --> 00:02:23.730
I'm tired again!"

